            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mbung'a osirua loo mukateni neitu eisuijieki. Too nkolong'i naapishana inosa mukateni neitu eisuijieki, anaa enaaitanapa, te ina kata nategeluaki to lapa le Abibu; amu teilo apa apa iewuo aipang'u aing'uaa Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pooki natabolo enkoshoke e ng'otonye naa enaai, ilewa linono pooki, olbung'aiko loo nkishu, o lkikaunot pooki loo nkishu o loo nkerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
