          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 13.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore olkikau lo sikiria niwalu to lkuoo le ker, arashu ti nimiwalu nigil emurt enye. Ore ilkikaunot pooki loo layiok linono niwalu akordu nemetii hoo obo olotu dukuya nanu meeta toki.",
          "type": "text",
