            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.3.7+2CO.3.8+2CO.3.9+2CO.3.10+2CO.3.11+2CO.3.12+2CO.3.13+2CO.3.14+2CO.3.15+2CO.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilkor 3.7-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee edou Musa to ldoinyo le Sinai, eeta mbaoi are dapashi e nchakenisho te nkaina enye elotu adou aing'uaa oldoinyo, neitu eyiolou Musa ajo etawang'a enkomom enye te nkaraki natigire airo te nebo Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edol Aron o ltung'ana pooki loo Siraeli Musa, ng'ura, kewang enkomom enye, neureyu ninche epuonu aanyikaki ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eipotuo Musa ninche; neshukokino ninye Aron o larikok pooki lo lorere, neiro Musa te nebo ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi nepuonu aanyiku iltung'ana pooki loo Siraeli, neisho ninye ninche te nkitanapata nena pooki naairoro Olaitoriani te nebo ninye to ldoinyo le Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip Musa airorie ninche neitoip enkomom enye te nkarasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake tenelo Musa dukuya Olaitoriani airo te nebo ninye, neiwuang'ie ina arasha naitoipie enkomom, o metaba anaa nelotu boo; naa ore te nelotu boo neliki iltung'ana loo Siraeli ina naitanapaki ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedol iltung'ana loo Siraeli enkomom e Musa, neitoki Musa aitoip enkomom enye ometaba anaa nelo atua airo tenebo ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.35"
            ]
          }
        }
